# 7-Provider Real-Time Global News API Configuration

# 1. NewsAPI (Global News Wire)
NEWS_API_KEY=Enter_You_API_KEY

# 2. NewsData.io (International & Regional News)
NEWSDATA_API_KEY=Enter_You_API_KEY

# 3. GNews.io (Breaking News Search)
GNEWS_API_KEY=Enter_You_API_KEY

# 4. WorldNewsAPI.com (Worldwide Multilingual News Search)
WORLDNEWS_API_KEY=Enter_You_API_KEY

# 5. The Guardian Open Platform (Global Quality Journalism)
GUARDIAN_API_KEY=Enter_You_API_KEY

# 6. Currents API (Fast Real-Time Global News Wire)
CURRENTS_API_KEY=Enter_You_API_KEY

# 7. Mediastack API (Live Worldwide News Data Feed)
MEDIASTACK_API_KEY=Enter_You_API_KEY
